WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:02.855
- Since extending Taco
Tuesdays to Wednesday

00:00:02.855 --> 00:00:05.856
we have seen a 13% increase in followers.

00:00:05.856 --> 00:00:06.877
- I see.

00:00:06.877 --> 00:00:08.850
- And we have some really
great promotions for August.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.474
- About August, we were
thinking this might

00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:14.678
be a good time to go with a new agency.

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:15.450
- Really?

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.491
- Unless you've got something
else that you can show me.

00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:22.486
- No. I mean, it seems
like your mind is made up.

00:00:22.486 --> 00:00:23.722
- Alright then. Bye.

00:00:25.932 --> 00:00:27.433
(distant phone ringing)

00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:30.821
- So should I stop working
on Taco Shark Week?

00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:33.416
- They were our oldest client.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.891
How do you do it Elliott?

00:00:34.891 --> 00:00:35.767
- Do what?

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.016
- Fail.

00:00:37.016 --> 00:00:37.857
- Fail?

00:00:37.857 --> 00:00:39.622
- You walk around with
your pants unbuttoned.

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.688
You can't get a fortune out of a cookie

00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:43.341
so you eat the whole thing.

00:00:43.341 --> 00:00:45.287
No one can remember your dumb name.

00:00:45.287 --> 00:00:48.677
- Well I'm working on a new
nickname, E Dog or L Train.

00:00:48.677 --> 00:00:51.747
- And all your boss
can do is lose clients.

00:00:51.747 --> 00:00:53.181
- It'll be okay.

00:00:53.181 --> 00:00:54.982
- What are you doing?

00:00:54.982 --> 00:00:56.385
- I thought you needed a hug.

00:00:56.385 --> 00:00:57.619
- I don't like to be touched.

00:00:57.619 --> 00:00:59.520
- Oh yeah, I forgot, I'm sorry.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.873
I'll just go.

00:01:03.421 --> 00:01:07.733
- Maybe I should just go.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.597
- Hey why didn't you fight for it?

00:01:09.597 --> 00:01:11.221
We had great ideas.

00:01:11.223 --> 00:01:13.935
- I know but I got nervous.

00:01:13.935 --> 00:01:16.354
- The only time I'm not
nervous is the moment I wake up

00:01:16.354 --> 00:01:18.119
and I'm trying to figure
out if it's real life

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:19.419
or a waking nightmare.

00:01:19.419 --> 00:01:21.857
- Actual confrontation is
a little different Elliott.

00:01:21.857 --> 00:01:24.652
- But you're the boss,
this is what you do.

00:01:24.652 --> 00:01:25.665
- What do you know?

00:01:25.665 --> 00:01:27.337
You let people walk all over you.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:30.007
- But I'm not the boss
here, I am the boss at home.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:31.841
- You live alone.

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:35.695
- Well, Mr. Harris and Britney
Purrs are my employees.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.605
- No, they're your cats.

00:01:37.605 --> 00:01:41.082
- My incredibly well
behaved cats, who can use

00:01:41.082 --> 00:01:44.755
a toilet because I insisted on it.

00:01:44.755 --> 00:01:47.926
I got an idea, come with old L Train.

00:01:48.743 --> 00:01:50.793
(plucky guitar music)

00:01:53.644 --> 00:01:56.490
- Summer, can you get some coffee?

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.054
- I'm super busy right
now, but how about later?

00:01:59.054 --> 00:02:01.602
- Okay, goodbye.

00:02:02.258 --> 00:02:02.801
- That's it?

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:05.044
You're the boss, this is your house, go.

00:02:07.444 --> 00:02:11.576
- Summer, I need you to get
me and Elliott some coffee.

00:02:11.576 --> 00:02:13.676
- Oh, sure thing boss.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.622
(plucky guitar music)

00:02:17.622 --> 00:02:19.592
- See isn't this great?

00:02:19.592 --> 00:02:23.199
- It's incredible, I asked
for something and I got it.

00:02:23.199 --> 00:02:25.472
- Now for something a
little more challenging.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.137
- Bennett, get up.

00:02:31.137 --> 00:02:32.112
(moans)

00:02:32.112 --> 00:02:34.635
It's 4pm you have to go back to work.

00:02:34.635 --> 00:02:36.501
- Five minutes.

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:39.078
- No, right now because we do not

00:02:39.078 --> 00:02:40.402
have siestas in this office.

00:02:40.402 --> 00:02:44.186
I don't care how many semesters
you spent in Barcelona.

00:02:44.186 --> 00:02:46.253
- It's pronounced Barthelona.

00:02:46.253 --> 00:02:47.182
- You're unbearable.

00:02:47.182 --> 00:02:48.829
Drink this and go back to your cube.

00:02:48.829 --> 00:02:50.266
- Fine.

00:02:50.266 --> 00:02:51.885
- Thank you.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:56.400
- I'm doing it, I'm being the boss.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.441
- Like a cat who can use a
toilet, you are unstoppable.

00:02:59.441 --> 00:03:01.508
- You're right Elliott.

00:03:01.508 --> 00:03:04.276
I want you to make a dating profile.

00:03:04.276 --> 00:03:05.963
- What?

00:03:05.963 --> 00:03:09.054
No this isn't about me, this is about you

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:11.236
becoming the person you were meant to be.

00:03:11.236 --> 00:03:12.699
- No I think this is about you expanding

00:03:12.699 --> 00:03:16.275
your horizons beyond cats
who shit like people.

00:03:16.275 --> 00:03:18.133
- I don't have any good photos

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:22.233
or favorite movie, or cool Ghandi quotes.

00:03:22.233 --> 00:03:23.152
- Hold still.

00:03:23.152 --> 00:03:24.344
- Okay, no no no.

00:03:24.344 --> 00:03:28.884
Here, I'll do it if you
call back Viva Taquito.

00:03:30.524 --> 00:03:34.073
- Mr. Taquito, this is Natalie.

00:03:34.073 --> 00:03:37.474
Your company needs to
connect with local teens.

00:03:37.474 --> 00:03:41.769
We are the only social
media company in the area

00:03:41.769 --> 00:03:44.440
that can get the job done right.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.244
With our guidance we can push

00:03:46.244 --> 00:03:50.184
Taco Tuesday straight through to Saturday,

00:03:50.184 --> 00:03:55.184
and God willing, maybe
even Sunday, excellent.

00:03:57.352 --> 00:03:58.814
(claps)

00:03:58.974 --> 00:04:00.080
- So what did he say?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.040
- I got the machine.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.619
- You did it.

00:04:03.619 --> 00:04:05.523
- I still don't like
being touched Elliott.

00:04:05.523 --> 00:04:08.541
- Oh yeah, sorry, forgot.

00:04:09.981 --> 00:04:12.852
- I hate it here, when I
turn 18 I'm moving out.

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:13.721
(laughter)

00:04:13.974 --> 00:04:16.424
(orchestra warm up)
(film projector)

00:04:16.424 --> 00:04:18.764
(dial up modem)

